# PCSX2 run data.  pcsx2/PCSX2/inis/PCSX2.ini is the configuration a run loads and
# stays tracked; everything else under pcsx2/ is created by running it, BIOS links
# included.
pcsx2/PCSX2/*
!pcsx2/PCSX2/inis/
pcsx2/PCSX2/inis/*
!pcsx2/PCSX2/inis/PCSX2.ini
